<urn:usf:secret-modelling-rule:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Model that a secret is required, what resolves it, and what breaks without it. Never model its value. A secret requirement is a name, a resolver and a consequence; a secret value is a liability authority must not be able to hold." <urn:usf:graph:delivery-contracts> .
